---
import { generateField } from '../lib/art-field';
import { url } from '../lib/urls';
const strands = generateField();
---

<figure class="generative-art">
  <div class="art-caption-top">
    <span>ITERATIVE FORM</span>
    <span>由简单规则，生出复杂。</span>
  </div>
  <svg class="field-art" viewBox="0 0 600 540" role="img" aria-labelledby="field-title field-desc">
    <title id="field-title">迭代成形</title>
    <desc id="field-desc">
      陶土、深青与橄榄色曲线，由同一规则反复迭代，围绕中央留白形成起伏的环形织面。
    </desc>
    <g fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
      {strands.map((strand) => (
        <path
          d={strand.points.map(([x, y], i) => `${i ? 'L' : 'M'}${x},${y}`).join('') + 'Z'}
          stroke={strand.color}
          stroke-opacity={strand.opacity}
          stroke-width={strand.weight}
        />
      ))}
    </g>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>
    <span>反复理解，逐渐成形。</span>
    <a href={url('art/iterative-form.html')}>
      探索这幅画 <span class="sr-only">（可调整参数）</span>
    </a>
  </figcaption>
</figure>
